{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>BlackHollow: 1870</strong> is a gritty first-person shooter set in the unforgiving world of the Wild West. Step into the boots of an outlaw and carve your path through tense shootouts, daring heists, and survival in hostile frontier lands. Whether you ride alone or join forces with others, every bullet and every choice shapes your legend.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Authentic Wild West FPS</strong> \u2013 Experience intense gunfights, bank robberies, and standoffs with sheriffs and rival gangs.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Singleplayer &amp; Multiplayer</strong> \u2013 Play solo in story-driven missions or team up in co-op. Challenge others in thrilling PvP shootouts.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Survival Elements</strong> \u2013 Manage ammo, supplies, and health while facing the dangers of the frontier.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Immersive Atmosphere</strong> \u2013 Explore dusty towns, dark forests, saloons, and lawless wastelands brought to life with realistic visuals.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Customization</strong> \u2013 Personalize your outlaw, upgrade weapons, and unlock new ways to dominate your enemies.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Forge your own story in <strong>BlackHollow: 1870</strong> \u2013 will you become a feared outlaw, a ruthless survivor, or a living legend of the Wild West?</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4028590?t=1758172023","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4028590/3af05879cb2ba94963dc6b859f4489ac4a3747b6/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1758172023","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4028590/62c855395ac1817777562cd695537794c2a14deb/capsule_23