ayer</strong> \u2013 Play solo in story-driven missions or team up in co-op. Challenge others in thrilling PvP shootouts.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Survival Elements</strong> \u2013 Manage ammo, supplies, and health while facing the dangers of the frontier.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Immersive Atmosphere</strong> \u2013 Explore dusty towns, dark forests, saloons, and lawless wastelands brought to life with realistic visuals.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Customization</strong> \u2013 Personalize your outlaw, upgrade weapons, and unlock new ways to dominate your enemies.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Forge your own story in <strong>BlackHollow: 1870</strong> \u2013 will you become a feared outlaw, a ruthless survivor, or a living legend of the Wild West?</p>","developers":["BlackHollow Studio"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Massively Multiplayer","id":"29"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4028590/211712ca429a6243068f5ff4c1b7dd34f77803e2/header.jpg?t=1758172023","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4028590/1673528848/8f1565dee216cb6add6eff0426ee0606fefc087e/1757759341/dash_av1.mpd?t=1758172021","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4028590/1673528848/8f1565dee216cb6add6eff0426ee0606fefc087e/1757759341/dash_h264.mpd?t=1758172021","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4028590/1673528848/8f1565dee216cb6add6eff0426ee0606fefc087e/1757759341/hls_